<title>UK: Gulf International Bank sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Gulf International Bank sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GULF INTERNATIONAL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY   *07.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +32.5 BP  PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     ISS PRICE  99.89     REOFFER     99.89</p>
<p> NOTES	*DEAL IS CALLABLE YEARS THREE AND FOUR</p>
<p> MOODY	BBB+	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BAA2	DENOMS (K) 10-100    TALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p>TAX PROVS  STANDARD -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
